{"id":72788,"date":"2026-11-04T08:45:39","date_gmt":"2026-11-04T08:45:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72788"},"modified":"2026-11-04T13:58:00","modified_gmt":"2026-11-04T12:58:00","slug":"vineyards-backyard","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/vineyards-backyard\/","title":{"rendered":"Vineyards Backyard 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Vineyards Backyard 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Vineyards Backyard 2027<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>23 de janeiro de 2027<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado), com partida agendada para as <strong>09:00<\/strong> na <strong>Paisagem da Vinha do Pico \u2013 Cria\u00e7\u00e3o Velha<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Madalena<\/strong>, <strong>Ilha do Pico (A\u00e7ores)<\/strong>. Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos de Lava<\/strong>, o evento leva o formato mundial de resist\u00eancia <em>Backyard Ultra<\/em> a um cen\u00e1rio classificado como Patrim\u00f3nio Mundial da UNESCO, por entre os emblem\u00e1ticos currais de vinha em pedra bas\u00e1ltica e a orla costeira da ilha montanha.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa desportivo adapta-se a diferentes n\u00edveis de experi\u00eancia atrav\u00e9s de tr\u00eas variantes: o formato cl\u00e1ssico <strong>Vineyards Backyard<\/strong> (onde os atletas percorrem o circuito padr\u00e3o de 6,706 km a cada hora at\u00e9 restar apenas o \u00faltimo resistente em prova), o desafio interm\u00e9dio <strong>Vineyards Backyard 6 Voltas<\/strong> (~40,2 km acumulados) e a op\u00e7\u00e3o <strong>Vineyards Backyard 3 Voltas<\/strong> (~20,1 km acumulados). As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e respetivos pagamentos encontram-se dispon\u00edveis at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23:59 de 18 de janeiro de 2027. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">23 de Janeiro de 2027 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Cria\u00e7\u00e3o Velha, Madalena, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Backyard Ultra (Voltas de 6,706 km), 6 Voltas (40,2 km) e 3 Voltas (20,1 km)<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; tex