: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Backyard Ultra<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vineyards Backyard 6 Voltas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 1h00 por volta<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">15,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Backyard Ultra<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Vineyards Backyard 3 Voltas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 23 de Janeiro de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00 \u2022 \u23f1\ufe0f Limite: 1h00 por volta<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">10,00 \u20ac (at\u00e9 18\/01\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o Vineyards Backyard 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Vineyards Backyard 2027 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 23 de janeiro de 2027, com partida da primeira volta marcada para as 09:00, na Paisagem da Vinha do Pico \u2013 Cria\u00e7\u00e3o Velha, no concelho da Madalena, Ilha do Pico (A\u00e7ores).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os formatos e dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis no Vineyards Backyard 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento disp\u00f5e de tr\u00eas formatos sobre o circuito regulamentar de 6,706 km (4,167 milhas) com partida a cada hora: o formato principal Vineyards Backyard (sem limite pr\u00e9-definido de voltas, vencendo o \u00faltimo atleta a concluir uma volta em menos de 60 minutos), o Vineyards Backyard 6 Voltas (~40,2 km) e o Vineyards Backyard 3 Voltas (~20,1 km).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e o prazo de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00eam o custo de 25,00 \u20ac para o Vineyards Backyard (formato ilimitado), 15,00 \u20ac para o Vineyards Backyard 6 Voltas e 10,00 \u20ac para o Vineyards Backyard 3 Voltas. O prazo de pagamento encerra na segunda-feira, 18 de janeiro de 2027, \u00e0s 23:59.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a entidade organizadora e o contacto de apoio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova \u00e9 organizada pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos de Lava, na Ilha do Pico (A\u00e7ores), disponibilizando o contacto telef\u00f3nico 912 605 505 para esclarecimentos t\u00e9cnicos e log\u00edsticos.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona a regra hor\u00e1ria de uma prova Backyard Ultra?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No modelo Backyard Ultra, os atletas partem exatamente no in\u00edcio de cada hora para percorrer um anel de 6,706 km. Quem terminar a volta antes dos 60 minutos utiliza o tempo restante para recuperar e abastecer at\u00e9 ao sinal sonoro da volta seguinte; quem n\u00e3o concluir dentro da hora ou n\u00e3o alinhar na partida seguinte \u00e9 eliminado.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Vineyards Backyard 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"endDate\": \"2027-01-23\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Cria\u00e7\u00e3o Velha, Madalena\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Madalena\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Vineyards Backyard 2027 realiza-se a 23 de janeiro na Cria\u00e7\u00e3o Velha, Madalena (Ilha do Pico, A\u00e7ores). Consulta formatos Backyard, 6 e 3 voltas e inscreve-te!\", \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vineyards Backyard (Formato Ilimitado)\", \"price\": \"25.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4535\/info\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vineyards Backyard 6 Voltas\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4535\/info\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Vineyards Backyard 3 Voltas\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/4535\/info\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva Trilhos de Lava\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"ht