", \"text\": \"No modelo Backyard Ultra, os atletas partem exatamente no in\u00edcio de cada hora para percorrer um anel de 6,706 km. Quem terminar a volta antes dos 60 minutos utiliza o tempo restante para recuperar e abastecer at\u00e9 ao sinal sonoro da volta seguinte; quem n\u00e3o concluir dentro da hora ou n\u00e3o alinhar na partida seguinte \u00e9 eliminado.\"}}]}<\/script>","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[1354,22],"event_type_2":[104,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-72788","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","hentry","event_type-backyard-2","event_type-trail","event_type_2-acores","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72788","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=72788"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72788\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":72791,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/72788\/revisions\/72791"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=72788"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=72788"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/eve